 - Writes require the `contributor` or `manager` role in the project. Users who can read but not write get 403.
 - Contributors may only modify tasks assigned to themselves, and may not reassign tasks. Managers may modify any task.
 - Only managers may delete tasks.
+- Only managers may freeze a project (others 403). Freezing sets every member's role to `viewer`, managers included, and unassigns the project's tasks (an assignee must be a contributor or manager). Afterwards nobody can change the project's tasks. Freezing is not undone by any endpoint.
